									"text" : "{{P::style_key:page_bold;&&New Game}}{{P::style_key:page_normal;&& }}{{P::style_key:page_normal;&&Select NEW GAME from the Main Menu and choose one of the two available save slots, called CHRONICLE 1 and CHRONICLE 2, to begin Kutaro’s adventure from the beginning.}}{{P::style_key:page_normal;&& }}{{P::style_key:page_bold;&&Resuming a Saved Game}}{{P::style_key:page_normal;&& }}{{P::style_key:page_normal;&&Choose CONTINUE from the Main Menu and select the appropriate Program to resume an adventure in progress. You can choose to resume play from the middle of a scene, or begin at the scene selector screen.}}{{P::style_key:page_normal;&& }}{{P::style_key:page_bold;&&Saving}}{{P::style_key:page_normal;&& }}{{P::style_key:page_normal;&&<<<ELEMENT::element_key:autosave_icon;>>> Puppeteer™ automatically saves your progress at various points in the game, indicated by a spinning icon in the lower-right corner of the screen. Do not exit the game or turn off your PlayStation®3 system while the save icon is visible. Doing so may damage your save file.}}",
