									"y" : "0",
									"header_text" : "",
									"text" : "{{P::style_key:page_bold;&&Heads}}{{P::style_key:page_normal;&& }}{{P::style_key:page_normal;&&<<<ELEMENT::element_key:screenshots/gamescreen;>>>The display in the upper-left corner shows the different Heads you have in your possession. Kutaro can have a maximum of three Heads in his possession at once.}}{{P::style_key:page_normal;&& }}{{P::style_key:page_bold;&&Moonsparkle Counter}}{{P::style_key:page_normal;&& }}{{P::style_key:page_normal;&&Displays the number of Moonsparkles that have been collected. Moonsparkles come in two sizes, small and large. Kutaro gains an extra life for every 100 Moonsparkles he collects.}}{{P::style_key:page_normal;&& }}{{P::style_key:page_bold;&&Lives}}{{P::style_key:page_normal;&& }}{{P::style_key:page_normal;&&Displays the number of lives remaining. When this number reaches zero, it’s game over.}}{{P::style_key:page_normal;&& }}{{P::style_key:page_bold;&&Companion}}{{P::style_key:page_normal;&& }}{{P::style_key:page_normal;&&Kutaro’s flying friends can reach areas he cannot in order to acquire hidden items. A second player can take control of this character with the PlayStation®Move motion controller or a second wireless controller. Please see the “Investigating” portion in the “How to Play” section of this manual for more details.}}",
