							},
							"elements" :
							[
								{
									"item" : "ELEMENT",
									"key" : "flow_text",
									"type" : "flow_text",
									"x" : "0",
									"y" : "0",
									"header_text" : "",
									"text" : "{{P::style_key:page_subheader;&&Calibrus}}{{P::style_key:page_normal;&& }}{{P::style_key:page_normal;&&Calibrus is the name of a legendary pair of magical scissors acquired by Kutaro early on in his adventure. It serves not only as a primary weapon, but also as a invaluable tool to help Kutaro traverse dangerous areas.}}{{P::style_key:page_normal;&& }}{{P::style_key:page_bold;&&Basic Cut}}{{P::style_key:page_normal;&& }}{{P::style_key:page_normal;&&<<<ELEMENT::element_key:screenshots/cut;>>>Press {F} to cut, or rapidly press {F} to cut rapidly. You can change the direction of the cut by holding the left stick in the desired direction while pressing {F}.}}{{P::style_key:page_normal;&& }}{{P::style_key:page_normal;&& }}{{P::style_key:page_bold;&&Sky Cut}}{{P::style_key:page_normal;&& }}{{P::style_key:page_normal;&&<<<ELEMENT::element_key:screenshots/skycut;>>>Press {F} while in the air to perform a Sky Cut. Kutaro automatically moves in the direction of the Sky Cut as long as there is material for Calibrus to slice into. Rapidly press {F} and move the left stick to guide Kutaro through cutting material.}}{{P::style_key:page_normal;&& }}{{P::style_key:page_bold;&&Seam Cut}}{{P::style_key:page_normal;&& }}{{P::style_key:page_normal;&&<<<ELEMENT::element_key:screenshots/zipcut;>>>Kutaro can often come across fabric seams in the environment. These seams are places where Kutaro can perform a Seam Cut. Press {F} to cut into the seam, then rapidly press {F} to continue following the seam line. The faster you press {F}, the faster Kutaro moves across the seam}}{{P::style_key:page_normal;&& }}{{P::style_key:page_normal;&&Press {S} to jump out of a Zip Cut at any time, otherwise Kutaro automatically exits at the end of the seam.}}",
