									"x" : "0",
									"y" : "0",
									"header_text" : "",
									"text" : "{{P::style_key:page_normal;&& }}{{P::style_key:page_normal;&& <<<ELEMENT::element_key:screenshots/mainmenu_en;>>>}}{{P::style_key:page_bold;&&Stage Select}}{{P::style_key:page_normal;&& }}{{P::style_key:page_normal;&&Highlight the Stage Select option and press {◀} or {▶} to scroll through the available Acts. Puppeteer™ is split into seven Acts, each consisting of three Curtains. Complete all three Curtains in a single Act to move on to the next one.}}{{P::style_key:page_normal;&& }}{{P::style_key:page_bold;&&Bonus Stage Selection}}{{P::style_key:page_normal;&& }}{{P::style_key:page_normal;&&Each Act has three hidden Bonus Stages to find. You can replay any Bonus Stages you have unlocked from this menu.}}{{P::style_key:page_normal;&& }}{{P::style_key:page_bold;&&Head Collection}}{{P::style_key:page_normal;&& }}{{P::style_key:page_normal;&&Each Act has its own unique set of basic Heads. Enter this menu to view the Head Story and Head Action for each one you have found. Press {Q}/{E} to scroll between the different display cabinets, highlight a Head, then press {S} to view its details.}}{{P::style_key:page_normal;&& }}{{P::style_key:page_bold;&&Picture Book}}{{P::style_key:page_normal;&& }}{{P::style_key:page_normal;&&You unlock a new Picture Book each time you complete an Act. Each Picture Book retails a classic children’s tale, with a Puppeteer™ twist.}}",
