									"text" : "{{P::style_key:page_normal;&&Press {w} during gameplay to access the pause menu.}}{{P::style_key:page_normal;&& }}{{P::style_key:page_bold;&&Resume}}{{P::style_key:page_normal;&& }}{{P::style_key:page_normal;&&Exit the pause menu and return to the game in progress.}}{{P::style_key:page_normal;&& }}{{P::style_key:page_bold;&&Options}}{{P::style_key:page_normal;&& }}{{P::style_key:page_normal;&&Access the Options menu where you can adjust Screen and Audio settings, switch between One Player and Two Player modes, or recalibrate the motion controller.}}{{P::style_key:page_normal;&& }}{{P::style_key:page_bold;&&Controls}}{{P::style_key:page_normal;&& }}{{P::style_key:page_normal;&&View a diagram of the Puppeteer™ controls.}}{{P::style_key:page_normal;&& }}{{P::style_key:page_bold;&&Select an Act}}{{P::style_key:page_normal;&& }}{{P::style_key:page_normal;&&Exit the current level and return to the Stage Select menu for the current Act.}}{{P::style_key:page_normal;&& }}{{P::style_key:page_bold;&&Title Screen}}{{P::style_key:page_normal;&& }}{{P::style_key:page_normal;&&Quit the game in progress and return to the main menu.}}",
